      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Cast Boomerang Basics before playing a land for the turn. Should play Misty Rainforest first to preserve options and maximize mana. Playing the land first costs nothing and leaves open more lines, including potentially holding up Daze with more Islands or having more mana available. Additionally, bouncing your own permanent for a card is low value when you could develop the board more efficiently.",
