    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Bouncing Dragon's Rage Channeler instead of Stormchaser's Talent loses a turn of attacking with a 3/3 flyer (the primary clock) and misses the opportunity to replay Stormchaser's Talent to generate an additional Otter token. DRC is the best threat on board and should stay in play.",
      "action_taken": "Bounced Dragon's Rage Channeler with Boomerang Basics",
